{"4272030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Obscure Figures", "steam_appid": 4272030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a psychological horror game and walking simulator. Only half of the rooms are safe. When you enter an unsafe room, you must leave immediately. Ghosts can be dispelled with a flute or a guitar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only half of the rooms are safe. When you enter an unsafe room, you must leave immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corridor, you may encounter wandering ghosts. To dispel them, you must play the flute or use the guitar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some ghosts can forcibly shift your camera from first‑person to third‑person. To escape them, you must move out of their camera view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you can’t escape a room in time. In those cases, you must hide until the ghost disappears.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide or leave immediately when a ghost appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272030/extras/7d6b01d78e61cc1d22fe79b9de1d3076.poster.avif?t=1769869044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272030/extras/7d6b01d78e61cc1d22fe79b9de1d3076.webm?t=1769869044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272030/extras/7d6b01d78e61cc1d22fe79b9de1d3076.mp4?t=1769869044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off your devices and close your curtains while watching for movement in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas